    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like evolution though. it feels like a decline. i can see the cliff i'm walking toward and i know there's nothing on the other side but being a total mediocrity. i'd honestly rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
